            {
                "entry_id": "ca593562-71bf-3e9b-8394-4e99ff5dbe92",
                "word": "potencjalnie",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "pl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "817c6c97-3464-3f0d-ae4f-2a34bb4b9e02",
                        "entry_id": "ca593562-71bf-3e9b-8394-4e99ff5dbe92",
                        "glosses": [
                            "w sposób potencjalny, mogąc wystąpić lub pojawić się w określonych warunkach"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b8ceab6-6853-4084-b19a-59561020d43f",
                                "sense_id": "817c6c97-3464-3f0d-ae4f-2a34bb4b9e02",
                                "text": "Wśród duńskich norek wykryto szczególną mutację koronawirusa, co potencjalnie może stanowić poważne zagrożenie dla zdrowia publicznego na całym świecie."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b773ccc8-9b0d-4e12-baea-795d9c7cc223",
                        "source_entry_id": "ca593562-71bf-3e9b-8394-4e99ff5dbe92",
                        "source_sense_id": "817c6c97-3464-3f0d-ae4f-2a34bb4b9e02",
                        "target_lang_word": "potentially",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "potentially",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85361b78-611f-3e73-81f7-e45e4ada517b",
                                        "entry_id": "f1bc530e-68e3-3166-8723-4d19ae493d29",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a manner showing much potential; with the possibility of happening in a given way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a91504db-a7c1-463c-a151-d811c7864908",
                                                "sense_id": "85361b78-611f-3e73-81f7-e45e4ada517b",
                                                "text": "Nevertheless, it is clear that the global energy demand for air-conditioning will grow substantially as nations become more affluent, with the consequences of climate change potentially accelerating the demand."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72f32088-9932-4dc8-ae47-9e161345e0b3",
                                                "sense_id": "85361b78-611f-3e73-81f7-e45e4ada517b",
                                                "text": "Its impending end has rung alarm bells across social media, with a baseline tariff as high as 145% depending on the carrier set to take effect on Chinese imports, potentially more than doubling the cost for all those cheap products deal-hungry Americans scooped up."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b03154f7-0f73-3ba8-92f9-baf34c1328e8",
                                        "entry_id": "f1bc530e-68e3-3166-8723-4d19ae493d29",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Powerfully, strongly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92f062a8-2f80-465c-a8d0-35a6b04daa23",
                                                "sense_id": "b03154f7-0f73-3ba8-92f9-baf34c1328e8",
                                                "text": "I freely assert, that the cosmopolite philosopher cannot, for his life, point out one single peaceful influence, which within the last sixty years has operated more potentially upon the whole broad world, taken in one aggregate, than the high and mighty business of whaling."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ac1ea1b3-a0ab-485b-9db4-9ee93abf99b0",
                        "source_entry_id": "ca593562-71bf-3e9b-8394-4e99ff5dbe92",
                        "source_sense_id": "817c6c97-3464-3f0d-ae4f-2a34bb4b9e02",
                        "target_lang_word": "virtually",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "virtually",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8562c707-d227-3583-a389-518fd82ef695",
                                        "entry_id": "cae5358a-8de4-3009-8438-b5525657cf59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Almost but not quite."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93b870e2-392f-47ed-8310-0260cd1e0b8d",
                                                "sense_id": "8562c707-d227-3583-a389-518fd82ef695",
                                                "text": "Investors face a quandary. Cash offers a return of virtually zero in many developed countries; government-bond yields may have risen in recent weeks but they are still unattractive. Equities have suffered two big bear markets since 2000 and are wobbling again. It is hardly surprising that pension funds, insurers and endowments are searching for new sources of return."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8357bbb-f856-41f8-994d-1a58696684f0",
                                                "sense_id": "8562c707-d227-3583-a389-518fd82ef695",
                                                "text": "With our Medicare supplemental insurance plan, there are virtually no claim forms to fill out. (Advertisement)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e0103a8-4243-46b2-a463-0571b5e1a83b",
                                                "sense_id": "8562c707-d227-3583-a389-518fd82ef695",
                                                "text": "By surviving the first six minutes Hargreaves matched the total amount of playing time he had managed previously in virtually three years - and by scoring his first goal since April 2008 he set the hosts on their way to a fifth win of the season in all competitions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ab215d8-141f-3641-b7ba-6cbf9b3955cb",
                                        "entry_id": "cae5358a-8de4-3009-8438-b5525657cf59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In essence or functionally, but not in fact, formally, or technically."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f89d1ec2-2a43-4655-955e-be4b7117748e",
                                                "sense_id": "4ab215d8-141f-3641-b7ba-6cbf9b3955cb",
                                                "text": "virtually a member of the family"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75e31d97-1fde-3394-a19a-fe16171806a4",
                                        "entry_id": "cae5358a-8de4-3009-8438-b5525657cf59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a subgroup of finite index."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "573e399b-e0dd-4ca9-82dd-9bacb73f5a8e",
                                                "sense_id": "75e31d97-1fde-3394-a19a-fe16171806a4",
                                                "text": "In this case W has a diagram with 2 vertices and one edge labelled ∞, and is therefore the infinite dihedral group. Thus W is virtually ℤ."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9252668c-1bb8-4b38-af40-2cc902859eba",
                                                "sense_id": "75e31d97-1fde-3394-a19a-fe16171806a4",
                                                "text": "In this paper, we are mainly concerned with homogeneity in the class of finitely generated virtually free groups, i.e. finitely generated groups with a free subgroup of finite index."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "94d1625c-ae09-3d66-955d-20441961d9b5",
                                        "entry_id": "cae5358a-8de4-3009-8438-b5525657cf59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a covering space of finite degree."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3288530f-1f0a-4482-81e5-43971c24e0c1",
                                                "sense_id": "94d1625c-ae09-3d66-955d-20441961d9b5",
                                                "text": "Another class of small manifolds consists of those that are not virtually Haken (a manifold is virtually Haken if it is finitely covered by a Haken manifold)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a312e733-2e8b-42d8-9c38-fdbc8c66d59c",
                                                "sense_id": "94d1625c-ae09-3d66-955d-20441961d9b5",
                                                "text": "We call a hyperplane Y in a VH-complex X virtually clean if there exists a finite-sheeted covering map p : X̂ → X and a connected component Y ⊆ p⁻¹Y such that the hyperplane Ŷ of X̂ is clean."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8bf5cbd7-bd88-33d6-90e0-2ea4a934c8c5",
                                        "entry_id": "cae5358a-8de4-3009-8438-b5525657cf59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "By computer or in cyberspace."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b436b908-0695-4244-977e-b9c11ff47f90",
                        "source_entry_id": "ca593562-71bf-3e9b-8394-4e99ff5dbe92",
                        "source_sense_id": "817c6c97-3464-3f0d-ae4f-2a34bb4b9e02",
                        "target_lang_word": "potentiellement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "potentiellement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24e4934f-fbd0-38bb-8836-d9073690264c",
                                        "entry_id": "3cbb98c1-929f-3b84-99e3-73d621c7e93c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière potentielle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a37840d9-66e4-412f-8711-acec8bf7c5f4",
                                                "sense_id": "24e4934f-fbd0-38bb-8836-d9073690264c",
                                                "text": "Mayr Ernst a défini l’espèce comme des « groupes de populations naturelles effectivement ou potentiellement interféconds qui sont reproductivement isolés des autres groupes de même nature »."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "272ee86e-12c7-469e-8c64-6221606f257e",
                                                "sense_id": "24e4934f-fbd0-38bb-8836-d9073690264c",
                                                "text": "Cela fait un an que l’on me promet que cela ne va pas durer toujours ; six mois que l’on me promet des traitements dont on me persuade inlassablement qu’ils doivent marcher potentiellement, mais qui, dans les faits, ne sont jamais ultra-convaincants."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
